      },
      {
        "task": "q16-task2",
        "slices": [
          {
            "fragment": "content-fragment-6a6525201c66dee02745ab1d",
            "span": [
              13,
              33
            ],
            "text": "（2）\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}"
          }
        ],
        "status": "MODEL_SOURCE_CANDIDATE"
      },
      {
        "task": "q16-task3",
        "slices": [
          {
            "fragment": "content-fragment-6a6525201c66dee02745ab1d",
            "span": [
              33,
              86
            ],
            "text": "（3）∵a²+（\\frac{a^{2}-1}{2}）²=\\frac{a^{4}+2a^{2}+1}{4}，"
          },
          {
            "fragment": "content-fragment-cfbf024d4eace3529059ade5",
            "span": [
              0,
              100
            ],
            "text": "（\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}）²=\\frac{a^{4}+2a^{2}+1}{4}，∴a²+（\\frac{a^{2}-1}{2}）²=（\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}）²。又∵a为奇数，且"
          },
          {
            "fragment": "content-fragment-782cd369a84d84ce1b8f82d8",
            "span": [
              0,
              91
            ],
            "text": "a≥3，∴a，\\frac{a^{2}-1}{2}，\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}都是正整数。∴a，\\frac{a^{2}-1}{2}，\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}是勾股数。"
